type: software
title: "SessLint"
abstract: >-
  Offline, vendor-neutral session-integrity checker and conservative repair
  engine for tool-using AI agents. Detects and deterministically repairs
  structural corruption in agent execution ledgers (JSON/JSONL) before replay.
authors:
  - name: "SessLint Maintainers"
repository-code: "https://github.com/HPNChanel/sesslint"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/sesslint/"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-09-16"
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - session-integrity
  - linting
  - deterministic-repair
  - jsonl
